\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, all conversions are highly accurate. The calculator uses standard mathematical conversion constants and processes floating-point math locally in your browser. This ensures that whether you are converting data storage units or temperatures, you receive precise, reliable results for your projects.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use it on mobile devices?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes! Our unit converter is designed with responsive layouts that adapt to any screen size. You can access the tool from your mobile browser, select conversion categories, input values using the touch keyboard, and view results instantly on your smartphone or tablet.\"}}]}0:{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebApplication\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Quick Units Converter\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/utility/units-converter\\\",\\\"applicationCategory\\\":\\\"UtilityApplication\\\",\\\"operatingSystem\\\":\\\"All\\\",\\\"browserRequirements\\\":\\\"Requires HTML5, Javascript, Canvas\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Convert units of length, mass, temperature, area, volume, and data sizes.\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Utility Tools\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/category/utility\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\